OL,3,GNEWSABlind guide dog owner says quiet
OL,4,AEVs put lives at risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FA guide dog owner says some electric
OL,7,Fvehicles (EVs) are so quiet she
OL,8,Fstruggles to hear them approaching,
OL,9,Fleaving her feeling vulnerable at road
OL,10,Fcrossings.
OL,12,FMaisy McAdam, 29, from Swindon,
OL,13,FWiltshire, fears she could unknowingly
OL,14,Fwalk into danger with her guide dog
OL,15,FJaney because some EVs are so difficult
OL,16,Fto detect.
OL,18,FThe charity Guide Dogs is calling for
OL,19,Fchanges to rules governing the warning
OL,20,Fsounds fitted to EVs, arguing they are
OL,21,Fnot loud enough and cut out too
OL,22,Fquickly.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
