OL,3,GNEWSABlind guide dog owner says quiet
OL,4,AEVs put lives at risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department for Transport (DfT) said
OL,7,Frequirements for electric vehicle
OL,8,Fsounds were being kept "under review"
OL,9,Fas technology evolves.
